 "remarks": "The opportunity you've been waiting for at Marina Bay one of Stamford's most desirable waterfront communities. Tucked away in the highly sought-after Shippan neighborhood, this spacious 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhouse offers approximately 1,450 square feet of comfortable living space on two finished levels with hardwood floors throughout. Flooded with natural light the main level features a generously sized living room with fireplace, an open dining area, completely renovated kitchen featuring quartzite countertops/tile backsplash, and a private balcony. Head upstairs and you'll find the primary suite with its own full bath, walk-in closet, and an additional private balcony. A large second bedroom, upper-level laundry, and a full bath complete the thoughtfully designed second level. What truly sets Marina Bay apart is the lifestyle! From the unit, take the stairs directly down to open green space; an added bonus for enjoying the outdoors. Beautifully maintained grounds, a waterfront swimming pool, clubhouse, and picturesque views of Stamford Harbor and Long Island Sound surround the property. Spend summer afternoons poolside, watching the boats pass, or exploring nearby beaches and marinas. Ideally situated just minutes from downtown Stamford, Harbor Point, Metro-North, and an abundance of dining and shopping options, Marina Bay offers the perfect blend of coastal charm and convenience. $21,737 special assessment has been paid in full by the seller in one lump sum!",
